cff-version: 1.2.0
title: 'Yggdrasil Graph'
message: 'If you use this dataset or software, please cite it using this metadata.'
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Ueshima
    given-names: Yuichi
repository-code: 'https://github.com/omusubilabs/yggdrasil-graph'
url: 'https://yggdrasil-graph.omusubilabs.fi'
abstract: >-
  An interactive relationship graph of Norse mythology, built from cited
  primary sources. Entities are gods, giants, heroes, monsters, worlds and
  named things; edges are kinship, enmity, ownership, marriage and location.
  Every relation is traced to a chapter, stanza or printed page in a
  public-domain edition of the Poetic or Prose Edda, and where the sources
  disagree the graph records both readings.
keywords:
  - norse-mythology
  - poetic-edda
  - prose-edda
  - knowledge-graph
  - graph-visualization
  - digital-humanities
  - old-norse
  - open-data
